graph TD
  Q[Patient question] --> PG[Pre-flight gate<br/>deterministic screen + intent classifier]
  PG -->|emergency / crisis / out of scope / decision-adjacent| TPL[Safe pre-written reply<br/>routes to the right person]
  PG -->|allow, scoped| AG[Agent · scoped tools only]
  AG --> PF[Post-flight<br/>critical values · citation coverage · scope judge]
  PF -->|critical value or out of scope| TPL
  PF -->|cannot be published on its own| ESC[Clinician review queue<br/>patient sees a labelled draft]
  PF -->|pass| PUB[Publish · deterministic]
  PUB --> OUT[Answer + citations + autonomy level]
  ESC -->|clinician approves or edits| OUT
  TPL --> RES[Templated reply to the patient]
